WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.500
Import from Todoist or CSV. Bring tasks in from a Todoist export or any CSV, with a preview before anything is created.

2
00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:09.500
Use it for: moving from todoist; spreadsheet backlog.

3
00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Choose a CSV → Preview and map columns → Tasks, sections and tags created

4
00:00:15.580 --> 00:00:20.220
Pick the project to import into…

5
00:00:20.220 --> 00:00:20.340
…and a CSV. A Todoist export is recognised automatically.

6
00:00:20.340 --> 00:00:25.760
The preview shows what will be created — before anything is.

7
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:29.600
Import.

8
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:40.630
Any other CSV gets a column mapping.

9
00:00:40.630 --> 00:00:46.630
Some dates weren't read: The preview lists them; fix them in the CSV or set them after import.

10
00:00:46.630 --> 00:00:51.130
Todoist structure preserved
